Package: bloody-backup-manager
Version: 0.6.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, rsync, util-linux
Recommends: libgdk-pixbuf2.0-bin
Maintainer: BloodyTech
Description: Bloody Backup Manager - graphical Linux backup manager
 Thunar-like disk explorer with image thumbnails, cached on-demand folder sizes,
 disk browsing, organized rsync backups, and SHA-256 content verification before
 destructive space-freeing operations.
